{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43598","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 道政坊宝应寺 僧房联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 道政坊宝应寺 僧房联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古画思匡岭，上方疑傅岩。\n蝶闲移忍草，蝉晓揭高杉。\n香字消芝印，金经发茝函。\n井通松底脉，书坼洞中缄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}